  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe Tormach mill post appends parenthesized block explanations when Explain is on.\nExplain off keeps the existing program bytes.\nThe post adds original meanings for G38.2 and G59.1 through G59.3.\nEach new entry cites the [LinuxCNC G-code reference](https://linuxcnc.org/docs/stable/html/gcode/g-code.html), under Probing or Select Coordinate System.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe mill post did not declare an explanation form or call the shared explanation helper.\nThe engine therefore refused Explain on before running the post.\n\n## Tests\n\nAll three pins failed before the fix:\n\n- `tormach_explain_matrix_adds_only_inert_comments_and_keeps_refusals`\n- `tormach_explains_every_conformance_golden_without_changing_the_program`\n- `tormach_explains_linuxcnc_probe_and_extended_offsets`\n\nRestoring the whole old post made the pins fail.\nRestoring the fix made them pass.\nThe matrix checks metric and inch output, inert appended comments, and unchanged refusals.\nThe conformance pin strips the new comments and compares the executable bytes with the existing Explain-off programs.\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed with zero failures.\nClippy passed for camcraft-post and camcraft-app with all targets and warnings denied.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nAdded 13 Explain-on files under `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/tormach/`:\n\n- `explain_contour_disc_hole.nc`\n- `explain_contour_plate_with_hole.nc`\n- `explain_contour_tangential_lead.nc`\n- `explain_face_square_40x40.nc`\n- `explain_face_square_40x40_stepped.nc`\n- `explain_pocket_waterline_plate_with_island.nc`\n- `explain_pocket_zigzag_plate_with_island.nc`\n- `explain_slot_fullwidth_centerline.nc`\n- `explain_slot_wide_channel_rows.nc`\n- `explain_trace_plate_with_hole.nc`\n- `explain_drill_plate.nc`\n- `explain_drill_peck.nc`\n- `explain_tap_plate.nc`\n\nNo existing golden changed.\nEach added file keeps the executable bytes of its existing Explain-off program.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo real PathPilot machine or UI checkbox was exercised.\nThe lathe post was not changed.\nExisting intentional probe MSG comments stay unchanged.\nThe pins check that the new explanatory comments remain inert.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNo open PR touches the changed files.\nThe optional lathe work is deferred because PRs #1705, #1681, #518, #517 and #468 touch that post.\n\nChangelog: Add optional plain-English block explanations to the Tormach mill post.\nEffort: high\nFixes #1387\n",
